# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Language classification for GitHub language bars (repo card + profile stats)
#
# The real product lives in platform/ (Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind).
# Everything else at the workspace root is the superseded legacy
# Express/Vite FreeLLMAPI workspace (see docs/legacy-freellmapi-workspace.md) —
# kept only for reference.
#
# linguist-vendored removes those files from GitHub's language statistics,
# so iamhujju reports what is actually maintained: TypeScript.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Legacy Express + Vite workspace at the repo root
/*.js          linguist-vendored
/*.json        linguist-vendored
/*.html        linguist-vendored
/src/**        linguist-vendored
/services/**   linguist-vendored
/scripts/**    linguist-vendored
/scratch/**    linguist-vendored
/public/**     linguist-vendored
/prisma/**     linguist-vendored
/firebase.json       linguist-vendored
/firestore.rules     linguist-vendored
/skills-lock.json    linguist-vendored
